run frontend:(in .venv)
- python -m http.server 5500
- http://localhost:5500/frontend.html

run backend:(in .venv)
- uvicorn default_flow:app --reload

Latest run command:(To run both frontend and the backend)
- uvicorn default_flow:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000

Docker command:(Visit application on http://localhost:8000)
- docker run --env-file .env -p 8000:8000 <image name>